<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes<br />
<strong>Page type:</strong> Scp article<br />
<strong>Elevator Pitch</strong> A entity from a higher universe whose misty shadow is only seen by kids.<br />
<strong>Central narrative</strong> The entity can only be seen by kids, because they're less firmly rooted into our reality. About 3 percent of kids exhibit a secondary anomalous affect of having weather respond to their crying. Basically, it starts raining if the kid cries. This stops one the kid reaches 13.<br />
<strong>Hook/Attention Grabber</strong> Two agents trying to chase the entity while being given instructions by a kid who doesn't know left from right.<br />
<strong>Additional notes</strong> I don't know if the entity making kids anomalous is too much.</p>

