			<div class="content" id="post-content-4829580">
									

<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights</strong>: Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type</strong>: SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch</strong>: A viking shield that when held by a living person will cause a blue energy field to cover it. The energy field can redirect any damage that is inflicted upon it right back at the attacker (Examples: Shooting it with a gun will result in bullet wounds appearing in you or slashing at it with a sharp weapon will give you stab wounds and cuts). However, it does have its limits.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative</strong>: The shield was discovered in Norway in a viking ship burial by some archaeologists. The SCP came to the foundation's attention when reports of a cursed and powerful shield erupted upon its discovery so an investigation was initiated and the SCP was recovered. Tests and experiments were conducted to understand how it works which usually consisted of D-Class personnel and weaponized machinery attacking it.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber</strong>: It is unknown where the shield gots its anomalous ability and who the creator/original wielder was. It is also unknown how the SCP generates its energy field though it is possible that there is some sort of mystical or magical force surrounding it. The shield could provide potential use to the foundation, but if fallen into the wrong hands it could lead to many problems.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes</strong>: This is one of the first ideas I came up with and so far I'm not sure if there are any other SCPs that have a similar ability or concept, though I could be wrong.</p>

